      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Cedarhurst was incorporated as a village in 1910, marking its formal establishment on Long Island's South Shore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cedarhurst%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rail service arrived in 1869, sparking growth and leading to the 1878 construction of the Rockaway Hunting Club in Cedarhurst.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
