      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The opening scene of the 1987 film Married to the Mob was shot at Cedarhurst's train station, giving the town a spot in Hollywood history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
